 ('ENT_EMC_IGNATIUS_LOYOLA','member_of','ENT_EMC_JESUITS','high','Ignatius of Loyola founded and led the Society of Jesus (1540).'),
 ('ENT_EMC_FRANCIS_XAVIER','member_of','ENT_EMC_JESUITS','high','Francis Xavier was a founding companion of the Society of Jesus.'),
 ('ENT_EMC_PETER_FABER','member_of','ENT_EMC_JESUITS','high','Peter Faber was a founding companion of the Society of Jesus.'),
