 ('ENT_EMC_PETER_CANISIUS','member_of','ENT_EMC_JESUITS','high','Peter Canisius was a leading early Jesuit.'),
 ('ENT_EMC_ROBERT_BELLARMINE','member_of','ENT_EMC_JESUITS','high','Robert Bellarmine was a Jesuit cardinal and theologian.'),
