 ('ENT_EMC_JOHN_CROSS','member_of','ENT_EMC_DISCALCED_CARMELITES','high','John of the Cross co-founded the Discalced Carmelite reform.'),
 ('ENT_EMC_TERESA_AVILA','aligned_with','ENT_EMC_JOHN_CROSS','high','Teresa of Ávila and John of the Cross were co-reformers of the Carmelite order and spiritual collaborators.'),
