 ('ENT_EMC_FRANCIS_XAVIER','patron_of','ENT_MISSION','high','Francis Xavier is the patron saint of the missions.'),
 ('ENT_EMC_PETER_CLAVER','patron_of','ENT_MISSION','high','Peter Claver is patron of missionary work, especially African missions.'),
