 ('ENT_EMC_CAMILLUS_LELLIS','patron_of','ENT_HEALING','high','Camillus de Lellis is patron of the sick, hospitals and nurses.'),
 ('ENT_EMC_JOHN_OF_GOD','patron_of','ENT_HEALING','high','John of God is patron of hospitals and the sick.'),
 ('ENT_EMC_MARTIN_PORRES','patron_of','ENT_HEALING','medium','Martín de Porres is venerated as a healer and patron of the infirm.'),
 ('ENT_EMC_VINCENT_DE_PAUL','patron_of','ENT_POVERTY','high','Vincent de Paul is patron of charitable works for the poor.'),
 ('ENT_EMC_LOUISE_MARILLAC','patron_of','ENT_POVERTY','high','Louise de Marillac is patroness of social workers and service to the poor.'),
 ('ENT_EMC_BENEDICT_LABRE','patron_of','ENT_POVERTY','high','Benedict Joseph Labre is patron of the homeless and the destitute.'),
 ('ENT_EMC_PETER_CANISIUS','patron_of','ENT_KNOWLEDGE','medium','Peter Canisius, Doctor of the Church, is patron of catechists and Catholic education.'),
 ('ENT_EMC_ROBERT_BELLARMINE','patron_of','ENT_KNOWLEDGE','medium','Robert Bellarmine, Doctor of the Church, is patron of catechists and canonists.'),
 ('ENT_EMC_ALPHONSUS_LIGUORI','patron_of','ENT_KNOWLEDGE','medium','Alphonsus Liguori, Doctor of the Church, is patron of confessors and moral theologians.'),
 ('ENT_EMC_ISAAC_JOGUES','patron_of','ENT_MARTYRDOM','high','Isaac Jogues is venerated as a martyr of the North American missions.'),
 ('ENT_EMC_JEAN_DE_BREBEUF','patron_of','ENT_MARTYRDOM','high','Jean de Brébeuf is venerated as a martyr of the North American missions.'),
 ('ENT_EMC_JOSAPHAT_KUNCEVYC','patron_of','ENT_MARTYRDOM','high','Josaphat Kuntsevych is venerated as a martyr for church unity.'),
 ('ENT_EMC_NORTH_AMERICAN_MARTYRS','patron_of','ENT_MARTYRDOM','high','The North American Martyrs are a devotional collective venerated for martyrdom.'),
 ('ENT_EMC_OUR_LADY_GUADALUPE','reception_of','ENT_SAINT_MARY','high','Our Lady of Guadalupe is a Marian apparition and title of Mary Theotokos venerated in the Americas.'),
 ('ENT_EMC_ROSE_LIMA','patron_of','ENT_PRAYER','medium','Rose of Lima, Dominican mystic, is venerated as a model of penitential contemplative prayer.'),
 ('ENT_EMC_CATHERINE_RICCI','member_of','ENT_EMC_DISCALCED_CARMELITES','low','Catherine dei Ricci was a Dominican mystic loosely associated with Counter-Reformation Carmelite spirituality; weak link pending a Dominican hub.'),
